  "summary_en": "Consolidated German Road Traffic Act, including provisions on automated (§1a-1b) and autonomous driving functions in defined operating areas (§1d-1l): technical requirements, technical supervision, manufacturer duties, data storage, testing permits, and exemptions for state vehicles, alongside general licensing, penalties, and registers.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Autonomous vehicles may operate in approved defined operating areas with a KBA operating permit and technical supervision (§1d-1e).",
   "Accident-avoidance systems must prioritise human life and not weigh personal characteristics (§1e(2)).",
   "Manufacturers must prove cybersecurity, perform risk assessments, provide training, and report manipulations (§1f).",
   "Keepers must store operational data; KBA and third parties have restricted access (§1g).",
   "Testing requires KBA permits with on-site supervision; ministry empowered to issue implementing ordinances (§1i-1j)."
  ],
